# Generated and vendored files

Do not hand-edit these. Regenerate them with the tool that produced them.

| Path | Produced by | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `healthcare/public/frontend/assets/patient_portal-<hash>.js/.css/.map` | `yarn build` (Vite, frappe-ui) | Hashed, committed SPA bundle. Rebuild; don't patch it. |
| `healthcare/www/patient_portal.html` | frappe-ui Vite plugin (`indexHtmlPath`) | Rewritten on build |
| `healthcare/public/node_modules` | symlink/install artefact | Not source |
| `healthcare/locale/main.pot` | `.github/helper/update_pot_file.sh` / `generate-pot-file.yml` | Translation template. `.po` files come from Crowdin PRs. |
| `healthcare/__init__.py` `__version__` | semantic-release `prepareCmd` | Bumped automatically on release branches |
| `yarn.lock` | yarn | Lockfile. Update only through yarn. |
| `patient_portal/components.d.ts`, `patient_portal/auto-imports.d.ts` | unplugin auto-import via frappe-ui | Generated type shims |
| `.secrets.baseline` | `detect-secrets scan` | Update only through detect-secrets |
| DocType `*.json` | Frappe DocType editor (developer mode) | Editable by hand with care. Keep in sync with the controller. |

Ignored outputs (`.gitignore`): `dist/`, `node_modules/`, `__pycache__/`, `*.egg-info`, `healthcare/docs/current`. The pre-commit excludes also skip `healthcare/public/dist/` and `healthcare/public/frontend/assets/`.
